### 주문 생성 (정상)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 주문 생성 — items 누락 (400)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

{
  "items": []
}

### 주문 생성 — 존재하지 않는 상품 (404)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 99999, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 주문 생성 — 잘못된 비밀번호 (401)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: wrong-password

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 주문 생성 — 재고 부족 (400)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 999999 }
  ]
}

### 주문 생성 — 쿠폰 적용 (정상, couponId 는 본인 보유 AVAILABLE 쿠폰)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponId": 1
}

### 주문 생성 — 존재하지 않는 쿠폰 (404)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponId": 99999
}

### 주문 생성 — 이미 사용된 쿠폰 (400)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponId": 2
}

### 주문 생성 — 만료/최소주문금액 미달 쿠폰 (400)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponId": 3
}

### 주문 생성 — 타 유저 소유 쿠폰 (403)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponId": 4
}

### 주문 목록 조회 (본인, 기간 + 페이지)
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders?startAt=2024-01-01T00:00:00%2B09:00&endAt=2099-12-31T23:59:59%2B09:00&page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

### 주문 목록 조회 — startAt > endAt (400)
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders?startAt=2099-12-31T23:59:59%2B09:00&endAt=2024-01-01T00:00:00%2B09:00
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

### 주문 상세 조회 (본인)
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

### 주문 상세 조회 — 존재하지 않는 id (404)
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders/99999
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

### 주문 상세 조회 — 타인의 주문 (403)
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: stranger01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!
